    {
      "source": "A basic <a href=\"../../TypeComparator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>TypeComparator</code></a> implementation: supports comparison of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Number.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Number</code></a> types as well as types implementing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Comparable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Comparable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个基本的<a href=\"../../TypeComparator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>TypeComparator</code></a>实现：支持比较<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Number.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Number</code></a>类型以及实现<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Comparable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Comparable</code></a>的类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
